-- the standard the mapping computed for that pair — the strongest available
-- evidence that both describe one measurement. The fuller range then replaces
-- the lower-bound-only text (`height` becomes `4/5'`), `*_std` is untouched
-- because it is already that lower bound, and `size` is cleared.
